WEBVTT

01:41.570 --> 01:45.950
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.800 --> 01:48.940
[Episode 10]

01:49.100 --> 01:53.220
[Vast sea of knowledge]

02:04.230 --> 02:06.640
Chen's pan-fried buns from the capital.

02:07.110 --> 02:08.190
Seasonings:

02:08.350 --> 02:10.470
Half a spoon of aged vinegar from Hundred Flavor Shop,

02:11.000 --> 02:12.560
three drops of chili oil will suffice.

02:14.310 --> 02:15.560
The tofu from Bagong Mountain

02:16.070 --> 02:17.960
should be blanched with cilantro

02:18.170 --> 02:20.130
for it's fresh and exquisite taste to be fully appreciated.

02:21.910 --> 02:24.000
Grandmaster is truly a master

02:24.310 --> 02:25.800
to be able to indulge in such matters

02:25.800 --> 02:26.800
and compile them into a book.

02:28.890 --> 02:30.360
"Dishes and cooking,"

02:31.030 --> 02:32.360
"Famous wines and spirits,"

02:32.910 --> 02:34.310
"Curiosities and exotic objects,"

02:34.590 --> 02:35.840
"Famous mountains and interesting caves,"

02:36.870 --> 02:38.960
there really are reviews for everything.

02:40.910 --> 02:42.000
"Ferocious Beast Chapter."

02:42.470 --> 02:43.440
Could it be records

02:43.470 --> 02:45.120
of methods for raising ferocious beasts?

02:49.520 --> 02:50.630
Isn't this Master?

02:57.520 --> 02:59.079
Beast Shui.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.080
This beast is ferocious.

03:01.390 --> 03:02.590
Dislikes onions and garlic

03:03.280 --> 03:05.240
and enjoys salted dried longan.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.240
He's vengeful,

03:07.470 --> 03:08.750
so one has to be careful when teasing him.

03:09.190 --> 03:10.840
If you praise his appearance,

03:11.400 --> 03:12.630
his murderous intent will peak.

03:13.440 --> 03:15.120
He has to be teased gradually.

03:17.590 --> 03:18.790
Ferocious beast.

03:20.400 --> 03:22.280
Grandmaster's description is quite apt.

03:24.630 --> 03:25.800
To think

03:26.000 --> 03:27.710
this is how Grandmaster called Master.

03:30.360 --> 03:31.870
Shui...

03:34.470 --> 03:35.230
I wonder what was Master's

03:35.250 --> 03:36.370
expression like

03:36.400 --> 03:37.840
when he was called like this.

03:39.630 --> 03:40.840
Shui,

03:41.450 --> 03:42.100
Shui!

04:05.560 --> 04:06.310
Su Yishui.

04:06.910 --> 04:08.310
The 18 year term has come to an end.

04:08.810 --> 04:10.250
Today is the day when the demoness

04:10.280 --> 04:11.750
Mu Qingge will be reborn.

04:12.380 --> 04:14.220
We of the Heavenly righteous sect

04:14.660 --> 04:17.980
must put an end to this matter.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.000
Yishui,

04:23.360 --> 04:24.360
what do you mean by this?

04:25.360 --> 04:27.040
I said this 18 years ago,

04:27.390 --> 04:29.240
no one is allowed to approach the Reincarnation Tree.

04:29.870 --> 04:31.430
This tree was born from my core,

04:31.750 --> 04:33.510
and the living beings here are nourished by my spiritual power.

04:34.240 --> 04:35.720
Therefore, the power of all things on Mount Absolute

04:35.950 --> 04:37.240
is under my control.

04:37.750 --> 04:39.390
Before the Reincarnation Fruit is born,

04:40.120 --> 04:42.030
I ask for everyone to refrain from acting rashly.

04:47.040 --> 04:48.070
The Reincarnation Fruit has reached it's term.

04:48.630 --> 04:49.950
Mu Qingge is about to be reborn.

04:52.650 --> 04:54.850
There's so much written in this "Ferocious Beast Chapter."

04:55.830 --> 04:56.720
Looks like Grandmaster

04:56.720 --> 04:58.190
cared a lot about Master.

04:59.310 --> 05:01.360
It seems that she's not like the legendary

05:01.360 --> 05:02.680
great demoness as they say.

05:05.870 --> 05:06.680
Bai!

05:08.160 --> 05:09.070
Bai.

05:09.440 --> 05:10.420
Are you hungry?

05:13.120 --> 05:14.310
Bai, where are you going?

05:14.950 --> 05:15.670
Bai.

05:15.830 --> 05:16.830
Where are you going?

05:17.630 --> 05:18.190
Bai.

05:18.360 --> 05:19.360
Bai, come back!

05:19.560 --> 05:20.070
Bai.

05:20.800 --> 05:21.480
Bai!

05:22.600 --> 05:23.920
Why did you go into Master's room?

05:24.070 --> 05:24.630
Come out quickly.

05:25.000 --> 05:25.600
Come out, come out.

05:26.830 --> 05:27.390
Bai.

05:27.950 --> 05:28.560
Come here!

05:29.680 --> 05:30.960
Well, well, Xue Ranran.

05:31.150 --> 05:32.180
How could you

05:32.200 --> 05:33.010
sneak into Master's room?

05:33.430 --> 05:34.040
Tell me,

05:34.390 --> 05:35.750
what are you sneaking in here for?

05:36.120 --> 05:38.040
-Senior, I didn’t mean to,
-Senior!

05:38.070 --> 05:38.870
I was just…

05:42.310 --> 05:43.680
Why is the Water Mirror activated?

05:44.390 --> 05:46.190
The Reincarnation Tree.

05:46.480 --> 05:47.630
It's Mount Absolute.

05:48.220 --> 05:49.280
Master is there.

06:04.630 --> 06:05.780
It's been 18 years.

06:06.160 --> 06:08.830
This day has finally come.

06:13.970 --> 06:15.630
[Mu Ranwu]

06:16.630 --> 06:17.510
In this life,

06:18.450 --> 06:19.450
everything of Mu Qingge

06:19.480 --> 06:20.480
is now mine.

06:21.510 --> 06:23.070
But I refuse to have that

06:23.680 --> 06:25.120
disgusting face of yours.

06:26.630 --> 06:27.390
Look, look!

06:27.510 --> 06:28.310
It's changed, it's changed!

06:42.830 --> 06:43.800
This is Mu Qingge?

06:44.480 --> 06:45.510
Why does she look different?

06:45.960 --> 06:47.340
Although her appearance is different,

06:47.600 --> 06:49.240
her spiritual power and energy remain the same.

06:51.000 --> 06:51.850
It is Mu Qingge.

06:52.470 --> 06:53.920
The plum blossom mark on her face is still there.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.190
There's no mistake.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.430
Everyone,

07:05.750 --> 07:06.510
long time no see.

07:06.800 --> 07:08.240
Qingge pays her respects to all of you.

07:10.360 --> 07:10.750
This...

07:11.270 --> 07:12.600
This is our Grandmaster?

07:13.610 --> 07:15.160
She's born from the Reincarnation Fruit of Mount Absolute.

07:15.180 --> 07:16.420
It can't be anyone else, right?

07:19.070 --> 07:19.680
But...

07:20.140 --> 07:21.650
She seems to lack some of the

07:21.680 --> 07:22.950
reckless and arrogant aura from the portrait.

07:23.390 --> 07:24.240
Mu Qingge,

07:24.830 --> 07:26.510
your primordial spirit was completely scattered,

07:26.630 --> 07:27.270
yet you can still carry

07:27.270 --> 07:28.510
the memories of your previous life into reincarnation.

07:28.800 --> 07:29.970
You really are something.

07:32.110 --> 07:32.750
Activate the formation!

07:38.630 --> 07:39.680
Immortal Kaiyuan.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.390
I don't care what you do

07:41.390 --> 07:42.510
to Mu Qingge,

07:43.340 --> 07:44.870
but her life belongs to me.

07:45.830 --> 07:47.390
I have urgent matters to attend to.

07:47.920 --> 07:48.720
Rest assured.

07:49.390 --> 07:50.630
I know what I'm doing.

07:51.120 --> 07:52.000
Respected elders,

07:52.390 --> 07:53.830
I have been reborn,

07:53.920 --> 07:54.950
completely transformed.

07:55.159 --> 07:56.050
Why must you all

07:56.070 --> 07:57.460
cling to the past?

07:57.680 --> 07:58.360
Mu Qingge,

07:58.950 --> 07:59.800
let me ask you,

08:00.040 --> 08:01.360
where is the Spirit Spring now?

08:02.390 --> 08:03.070
The Spirit Spring?

08:03.600 --> 08:04.390
I don't know!

08:10.240 --> 08:12.360
I lost my connection to the Spirit Spring long ago.

08:12.750 --> 08:14.120
I have no idea where it is.

08:14.360 --> 08:15.430
If you don't believe me,

08:15.680 --> 08:17.070
you can probe my consciousness

08:17.310 --> 08:18.560
to verify the truth of my words.

08:19.040 --> 08:20.190
I won't resist!

08:29.480 --> 08:30.630
She truly doesn't know.

08:32.549 --> 08:33.600
This immortal-binding formation

08:33.960 --> 08:35.390
will lock your Spirit Root and spiritual bones.

08:35.669 --> 08:36.600
If you dare to try anything,

08:36.870 --> 08:38.510
it will surely shatter your bones and devour your heart.

08:38.750 --> 08:39.200
Retract.

08:42.409 --> 08:43.169
Fortunately, Mu Ranwu

08:43.200 --> 08:44.510
assumed Master's identity.

08:44.720 --> 08:46.030
Otherwise, with such a ruthless method

08:46.150 --> 08:47.320
and Ranran's current spiritual power,

08:47.670 --> 08:48.720
I'm afraid she wouldn't be able to withstand it at all.

08:53.870 --> 08:55.120
Golden Core stage.

08:55.320 --> 08:56.270
Five Spirit Roots.

08:57.520 --> 08:58.640
The Five Spirit Roots will greatly

08:58.670 --> 08:59.360
benefit my cultivation.

09:00.200 --> 09:01.030
I absolutely cannot let her

09:01.030 --> 09:02.030
fall into someone else's hands.

09:03.330 --> 09:04.930
This demoness has just been born,

09:04.960 --> 09:06.200
yet she already possesses such spiritual power.

09:07.030 --> 09:07.960
We must be on guard.

09:12.510 --> 09:13.120
Everyone,

09:14.000 --> 09:15.030
for the 18 years that I have spent

09:15.030 --> 09:16.270
living off this tree,

09:16.380 --> 09:17.540
I have spent

09:17.750 --> 09:19.720
every single moment of it repenting my sins

09:20.790 --> 09:21.840
and being grateful

09:22.220 --> 09:24.150
for the chance of rebirth that Yishui gave me.

09:25.000 --> 09:25.960
So this time,

09:26.030 --> 09:27.750
I must thoroughly reform myself

09:27.870 --> 09:28.750
and make amends

09:28.750 --> 09:30.120
for the crimes that I committed in the past.

09:30.870 --> 09:31.750
Mu Qingge,

09:31.840 --> 09:33.320
you say that you've reformed,

09:33.510 --> 09:34.150
but you still need to give everyone

09:34.150 --> 09:35.440
a convincing reason.

09:35.510 --> 09:36.440
Otherwise,

09:36.720 --> 09:38.320
don't you even think about leaving Mount Absolute today!

09:38.480 --> 09:39.080
Right!

09:39.240 --> 09:40.480
That's correct!

09:43.030 --> 09:43.910
Mu Qingge,

09:45.550 --> 09:47.360
now that you've seen me in this state,

09:48.110 --> 09:49.270
are you satisfied?

09:51.550 --> 09:52.240
Shui,

09:53.150 --> 09:54.150
it's all my fault

09:54.590 --> 09:56.710
for ruining your face with the Thorn Face Curse.

09:57.080 --> 09:58.720
Now that I've made up my mind

09:58.910 --> 10:00.550
to let go of all past grievances,

10:01.510 --> 10:02.790
I'll remove the curse from you right now.

10:03.030 --> 10:03.790
Is that alright?

10:09.030 --> 10:09.720
Very well.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.670
No need for me to say more.

10:11.960 --> 10:12.670
Hurry up and remove it.

10:13.910 --> 10:15.240
Since I've already used the Soul-Devouring Lock

10:15.440 --> 10:16.010
to take all of Qingge's

10:16.030 --> 10:17.150
spiritual power and Spirit Roots,

10:18.000 --> 10:18.790
it shouldn't be a problem

10:18.790 --> 10:19.630
for me to break

10:20.030 --> 10:21.150
the curse that she cast.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.000
His curse

10:34.960 --> 10:35.960
has finally been broken.

10:38.200 --> 10:40.130
I didn't know Master was so good-looking.

10:40.750 --> 10:42.670
Master's curse was clearly broken long ago,

10:43.000 --> 10:44.030
yet he's still putting on this act.

10:44.960 --> 10:46.910
Could it be that he's afraid that if the major sects find out,

10:47.120 --> 10:48.510
they won't allow Grandmaster to be reborn?

10:49.750 --> 10:50.550
It seems like

10:50.840 --> 10:51.840
Master still cares about

10:51.870 --> 10:53.080
the relationship they had.

10:57.150 --> 10:58.510
I have restored your appearance for you.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.270
The curse of Mount Wester

11:00.480 --> 11:01.480
has been broken from now on.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.030
What's in the past has been resolved.

11:04.330 --> 11:05.240
Please don't resent me anymore.

11:07.160 --> 11:08.880
Since Mu Qingge is willing to take the initiative

11:08.910 --> 11:09.790
to break the curse

11:10.030 --> 11:11.440
cast on Mount Wester and Su Yishui,

11:12.080 --> 11:14.440
it shows that she does have signs of repentance.

11:15.390 --> 11:17.200
This is for the best.

11:17.870 --> 11:18.910
Our Heavenly righteous sect

11:19.120 --> 11:20.440
has always been about saving people.

11:21.200 --> 11:21.910
However,

11:21.960 --> 11:22.840
in order to allow

11:22.860 --> 11:24.350
everyone to practice cultivation with peace of mind,

11:24.600 --> 11:25.200
Miss Mu,

11:25.510 --> 11:27.290
you'd better choose someone

11:27.320 --> 11:28.630
to become a disciple of again.

11:29.000 --> 11:31.440
This will also make it convenient for the righteous sect to supervise you

11:31.630 --> 11:33.270
and test your character,

11:33.480 --> 11:35.480
so that we can see your sincerity.

11:41.600 --> 11:42.750
The Soul-Devouring Lock is complicated.

11:43.070 --> 11:44.030
It cannot be unlocked for now.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.910
If all of you still don't trust me,

11:48.250 --> 11:49.090
why not I become a disciple of

11:49.120 --> 11:50.000
Su Yishui.

11:50.510 --> 11:52.940
I believe that his skills and character

11:53.200 --> 11:54.240
are trustworthy to everyone.

11:56.900 --> 11:57.900
The Wester Sect is small.

11:58.510 --> 12:00.030
I have already taken on several new disciples.

12:00.670 --> 12:02.360
I really don't have the energy to teach anyone else.

12:04.510 --> 12:05.550
Moreover, in the past,

12:05.870 --> 12:07.080
you were once considered my master.

12:07.480 --> 12:08.720
If you were to become my disciple now,

12:08.740 --> 12:10.270
wouldn't it disrupt the sect's rules and order?

12:11.200 --> 12:12.000
Besides, there would be

12:12.000 --> 12:13.550
the pressure from our past master-disciple relationship.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.000
I don't want to bear that.

12:18.150 --> 12:19.150
Since the curse has been broken,

12:19.750 --> 12:20.790
we have no more connection.

12:21.150 --> 12:22.120
Our debts are settled.

12:23.550 --> 12:24.670
Take care of yourself.

12:25.510 --> 12:25.960
Farewell.

12:27.200 --> 12:28.150
Since you're all here,

12:28.720 --> 12:30.270
no one is leaving.

12:33.960 --> 12:34.910
Beautiful Mu,

12:35.870 --> 12:37.150
it's been over a decade since we last met.

12:37.720 --> 12:39.000
Although your appearance has changed a bit,

12:39.790 --> 12:41.390
my longing for you

12:41.630 --> 12:42.960
hasn't changed at all.

12:43.630 --> 12:44.440
You demon,

12:44.870 --> 12:46.120
you've been coveting Mu Qingge's

12:46.150 --> 12:47.320
spiritual power for a long time.

12:47.960 --> 12:49.870
Today, all four major Heavenly sects are here.

12:50.270 --> 12:51.910
How can we allow your evil ambitions to succeed?

12:52.550 --> 12:54.320
I'm catching up with an old friend.

12:54.550 --> 12:55.600
Those who get in the way

12:56.200 --> 12:57.080
must die!

13:00.600 --> 13:01.790
You Demonic Sect scoundrel,

13:01.910 --> 13:03.670
we won't allow you to run wild here.

13:03.910 --> 13:04.750
Is that so?

13:05.360 --> 13:06.550
Then have a taste of this!

13:35.200 --> 13:36.320
Their spiritual power is leaking out.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.750
This formation reverses calamity and devours karma.

13:39.390 --> 13:40.750
It was made from

13:41.030 --> 13:42.600
Mu Qingge's blood that spilled when she died

13:42.630 --> 13:43.240
eighteen years ago.

13:43.750 --> 13:45.030
Each and every one of you

13:45.240 --> 13:46.510
has played a part in her death back then.

13:47.200 --> 13:48.600
Every effect has its cause.

13:48.790 --> 13:50.360
I have infused this place with resentment,

13:50.630 --> 13:51.960
setting up this formation in advance.

13:52.610 --> 13:53.640
It's already eager

13:53.670 --> 13:55.120
to devour you all.

13:56.240 --> 13:57.720
No matter how high your cultivation is,

13:58.000 --> 13:59.570
you will still be struck down

13:59.600 --> 14:00.320
by this reversal of karma.

14:02.030 --> 14:02.870
Beautiful Lady Mu,

14:03.240 --> 14:04.150
today I

14:04.360 --> 14:05.960
will avenge you for this great grudge.

14:06.630 --> 14:07.750
Are you satisfied?

14:08.720 --> 14:09.630
Don't do anything rash!

14:10.720 --> 14:12.240
What are you still hesitating for?

14:13.000 --> 14:13.720
This blood formation

14:13.910 --> 14:15.270
was created with your blood.

14:15.960 --> 14:17.510
You can control this drop of blood

14:17.790 --> 14:19.630
to activate the formation's final killing move

14:20.510 --> 14:21.630
and turn everyone here

14:21.960 --> 14:22.960
into dust.

14:23.440 --> 14:25.360
Let's usher in an era of demonic cultivation together!

14:25.550 --> 14:26.670
Wouldn't that be splendid?

14:27.390 --> 14:27.910
This is bad.

14:28.510 --> 14:29.750
If this formation really erupts,

14:30.270 --> 14:31.750
I'm afraid I'll be the first

14:32.030 --> 14:32.870
to lose my life here.

14:35.080 --> 14:37.120
It seems I'll have to be the one

14:37.150 --> 14:38.960
to make this decision for you.

14:39.440 --> 14:40.080
Alright,

14:40.840 --> 14:41.910
then I'll help you

14:42.510 --> 14:44.030
send these people to their deaths!

14:45.790 --> 14:46.360
No!

14:54.440 --> 14:55.270
Su Yishui,

14:55.630 --> 14:57.080
this blood formation can't suppress you.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.600
I've underestimated you.

14:58.890 --> 15:00.320
It's I who underestimated you.

15:01.080 --> 15:02.940
You actually used Mu Qingge as bait to set up this formation.

15:03.520 --> 15:05.400
It was Mu Qingge who was blind back then

15:05.790 --> 15:07.240
and was deceived by your face

15:07.840 --> 15:09.510
that made her miss out on such a good disciple as me.

15:09.960 --> 15:10.670
But it's just as well.

15:11.150 --> 15:12.320
Today, in front of her,

15:12.600 --> 15:13.630
I'll take your life

15:13.960 --> 15:15.200
and make her regret it!

15:30.200 --> 15:31.630
Before you set up this evil formation,

15:32.140 --> 15:33.080
you should have thought about whom the territory

15:33.080 --> 15:34.000
of Mount Absolute belongs to.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.320
You may have escaped alone,

15:36.320 --> 15:37.200
but so what?

15:37.510 --> 15:38.440
The others

15:38.720 --> 15:40.480
have already been struck by this blood formation.

15:41.030 --> 15:41.840
In no time,

15:42.150 --> 15:43.840
they will die from exhaustion of their spiritual power.

15:44.790 --> 15:45.360
By then,

15:46.080 --> 15:47.360
when this blood formation has absorbed

15:47.380 --> 15:48.730
enough spiritual power and resentment,

15:48.870 --> 15:49.870
that no matter how strong you are, Su Yishui,

15:50.150 --> 15:50.750
you won't be able to escape either.

15:51.150 --> 15:51.630
This is bad.

15:51.890 --> 15:52.570
No matter what,

15:52.600 --> 15:53.720
we need to go help Master!

15:57.960 --> 15:58.840
There's no response.

16:00.070 --> 16:00.710
Let's do it together.

16:00.870 --> 16:01.240
Alright.

16:15.200 --> 16:15.840
Mu Qingge,

16:16.280 --> 16:16.730
hurry!

16:17.270 --> 16:18.480
That drop of blood belongs to you.

16:18.500 --> 16:19.670
Destroy this formation immediately!

16:19.910 --> 16:20.550
Mu Qingge,

16:20.960 --> 16:22.550
these Heavenly righteous sects caused your tragic death.

16:22.960 --> 16:24.150
Do you still want to let them go?

16:24.670 --> 16:26.200
You and I are of the same kind.

16:26.390 --> 16:27.270
Come to me quickly!

16:27.440 --> 16:28.630
Mu Qingge, what are you waiting for?

16:28.670 --> 16:29.480
Hurry up and act!

16:29.720 --> 16:30.600
Damn Wei Jiu.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.110
if I can't break this formation,

16:32.240 --> 16:33.670
I'm afraid I won't last much longer.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.270
Now everything of Mu Qingge's

16:35.270 --> 16:36.150
is mine.

16:36.320 --> 16:37.630
If I can break her Thorn Face Curse,

16:37.870 --> 16:38.910
I can control

16:39.440 --> 16:40.480
this mere drop of blood too.

16:41.000 --> 16:41.750
Wei Jiu,

16:42.360 --> 16:43.670
I will never ally with you

16:43.910 --> 16:45.120
and let you harm the Heavenly Sect.

16:47.870 --> 16:48.450
Oh no.

16:51.670 --> 16:52.200
Stop!

16:58.330 --> 16:59.750
You can't break this formation?

17:01.630 --> 17:02.270
Mu Qingge,

17:02.800 --> 17:04.510
are you toying with us, not wanting to break the formation,

17:04.510 --> 17:05.829
or can you simply not break it?

17:18.550 --> 17:19.400
Mu Ranwu can't possibly

17:19.400 --> 17:20.400
break this formation.

17:20.790 --> 17:21.680
If this continues,

17:22.200 --> 17:23.480
the identity we just established for her

17:23.500 --> 17:24.430
will surely be exposed.

17:27.400 --> 17:27.960
What should we do?

17:28.400 --> 17:28.880
Try again!

17:34.700 --> 17:35.470
Ranran!

17:49.550 --> 17:50.960
Since it has come to this...

18:28.680 --> 18:29.680
I can't believe that

18:29.920 --> 18:31.000
I actually broke this formation!

18:31.880 --> 18:32.640
As expected,

18:33.080 --> 18:34.080
only Mu Qingge

18:34.110 --> 18:35.640
could break this blood formation.

18:41.350 --> 18:41.880
Master,

18:42.200 --> 18:42.880
are you alright?

18:43.000 --> 18:43.590
Nonsense!

18:44.270 --> 18:45.270
Who told you guys to come here?

18:54.880 --> 18:55.350
My Lord.

18:55.830 --> 18:56.510
Wei Jiu,

18:57.150 --> 18:58.750
I've already broken your formation.

18:59.350 --> 19:00.590
What other tricks do you have?

19:01.270 --> 19:02.680
So what if the formation is broken?

19:03.240 --> 19:04.160
These people have received

19:04.270 --> 19:05.510
the backlash of the blood formation.

19:06.030 --> 19:07.350
They're all seriously injured

19:07.640 --> 19:08.790
and can't use their spiritual power at all.

19:09.310 --> 19:10.790
But my people from the Scarlet Sect are different.

19:11.550 --> 19:13.920
After I deal with these nuisances,

19:14.110 --> 19:15.590
I'll take you back to the Scarlet Sect as well.

19:15.880 --> 19:16.310
Attack!

19:32.200 --> 19:33.440
This is the key to the netherworld!

19:33.680 --> 19:34.400
Indeed.

19:35.040 --> 19:36.170
Sovereign Wei, haven't you always

19:36.200 --> 19:37.240
wanted to obtain the Spirit Spring?

19:41.400 --> 19:42.310
You don't need to look at her.

19:42.920 --> 19:43.920
You should know

19:44.270 --> 19:45.750
that when she died in her previous life,

19:45.830 --> 19:47.270
the Spirit Spring was no longer in her body.

19:48.000 --> 19:48.920
For the past 18 years,

19:49.400 --> 19:51.160
there has been no trace of the Spirit Spring in the world.

19:51.400 --> 19:51.960
Therefore,

19:52.270 --> 19:53.640
those who want to find the Spirit Spring

19:53.880 --> 19:55.070
have all wanted to explore the netherworld.

19:55.830 --> 19:57.550
But the location of the netherworld is ever-changing.

19:57.790 --> 19:58.720
Without this item,

19:59.400 --> 20:00.110
even if one exhausts their entire life,

20:00.110 --> 20:01.480
it's impossible to find the gate to the netherworld.

20:02.000 --> 20:02.590
This key

20:03.290 --> 20:04.820
was in Mu Qingge's possession back then.

20:05.350 --> 20:06.880
After her death, its whereabouts became unknown.

20:07.720 --> 20:08.440
Su Yishui,

20:09.000 --> 20:10.350
we've asked you about this matter many times,

20:10.370 --> 20:11.370
but you never mentioned it.

20:12.110 --> 20:12.790
Today,

20:13.000 --> 20:14.040
you're bringing it out

20:14.070 --> 20:14.830
in front of the Demonic Sect.

20:15.160 --> 20:16.200
What do you mean by this?

20:16.640 --> 20:17.160
I'm tired.

20:17.510 --> 20:18.200
I can't fight anymore.

20:20.070 --> 20:21.640
I want to make a deal with Sovereign Wei.

20:22.640 --> 20:23.240
A deal?

20:23.750 --> 20:25.440
I want to make a soul oath with Sovereignr Wei.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.270
If Sovereign Wei agrees,

20:28.030 --> 20:29.550
I will present this item to you.

20:30.310 --> 20:31.030
Su Yishui!

20:31.960 --> 20:33.330
If Wei Jiu enters the netherworld

20:33.350 --> 20:34.260
and finds the Spirit Spring,

20:34.340 --> 20:36.140
aren't you letting demonic cultivators dominate the world?

20:40.920 --> 20:42.000
What kind of soul oath

20:42.160 --> 20:43.160
do you want to make with me?

20:44.270 --> 20:44.790
That's easy.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.070
You can't have your cake and eat it too.

20:47.750 --> 20:49.310
Sovereign Wei, if you want to explore the netherworld,

20:49.830 --> 20:50.720
then you can't harm

20:50.720 --> 20:51.590
Mu Qingge in the slightest.

20:55.240 --> 20:56.070
She still has

20:56.070 --> 20:57.000
half of my Golden Core.

20:57.440 --> 20:58.440
I don't want my Golden Core

20:58.440 --> 20:59.310
to suffer any mishap.

21:00.110 --> 21:01.400
So we need to make an oath.

21:01.960 --> 21:03.070
You must immediately order your Scarlet Sect members

21:03.070 --> 21:03.830
to withdraw from Mount Absolute.

21:04.070 --> 21:05.070
From now on, you must not harm

21:05.090 --> 21:06.090
Mu Qingge's life,

21:06.590 --> 21:08.270
nor use her for cultivation or to enhance your power.

21:08.790 --> 21:09.960
If you violate this oath,

21:10.590 --> 21:11.920
may you be struck down by heavenly tribulation

21:12.400 --> 21:13.550
and never be reincarnated.

21:13.890 --> 21:14.800
Mu Qingge's spiritual power,

21:14.830 --> 21:16.000
although beneficial to me,

21:16.550 --> 21:17.590
cannot compare to those

21:17.590 --> 21:18.790
ancient secret realms.

21:19.550 --> 21:21.000
These Heavenly righteous sects

21:21.260 --> 21:22.110
can be dealt with later.

21:22.510 --> 21:23.440
The key is more valuable.

21:26.160 --> 21:27.200
I am not opposed

21:28.070 --> 21:29.480
to your conditions.

21:30.590 --> 21:31.830
But how do I know

21:32.680 --> 21:34.680
if your key is real or fake?

21:35.680 --> 21:36.830
I can also make a soul oath

21:37.110 --> 21:38.350
guaranteeing that this key is genuine.

21:38.680 --> 21:40.110
But if you insist on continuing to fight,

21:40.790 --> 21:42.250
I will immediately grind it into powder.

21:43.310 --> 21:44.640
If what you say is true,

21:44.830 --> 21:45.680
then I

21:45.790 --> 21:46.960
will also keep my word.

21:47.270 --> 21:48.160
Su Yishui,

21:48.680 --> 21:50.360
I thought you were a model of righteousness,

21:50.880 --> 21:51.750
but now

21:51.770 --> 21:53.570
you're making deals with the tiger?

21:55.000 --> 21:56.270
Why are you wasting words with Wei Jiu?

21:56.790 --> 21:58.640
Hurry up and go kill him!

21:59.200 --> 22:00.240
If you want to go, then you go!

22:07.560 --> 22:08.550
You from the major sects

22:08.570 --> 22:10.090
are all just sitting here, unable to get up.

22:10.240 --> 22:11.640
My master tried to save you,

22:11.920 --> 22:13.270
and yet you don't even appreciate it?

22:13.790 --> 22:14.680
Look at the situation now—

22:14.880 --> 22:15.590
if defeating Wei Jiu

22:15.590 --> 22:16.680
were so easy,

22:17.200 --> 22:18.680
then why wouldn't you stand up and fight?

22:19.240 --> 22:20.720
Why must my master charge in alone?

22:21.070 --> 22:21.550
You—

22:23.070 --> 22:23.960
Oh, how nice for you—

22:24.210 --> 22:26.160
all this time, not exerting the slightest effort,

22:26.510 --> 22:28.110
just sitting there bickering.

22:28.750 --> 22:29.480
Is my master's life

22:29.480 --> 22:30.270
worth nothing to you?

22:30.680 --> 22:31.400
Insolence!

22:32.640 --> 22:33.270
Do you think

22:33.550 --> 22:34.750
a mere junior like you

22:34.770 --> 22:36.430
has the right to speak here?

22:36.640 --> 22:37.590
Where are your manners?

22:38.070 --> 22:38.920
Just because I have no cultivation,

22:38.920 --> 22:40.160
does that mean I can't speak?

22:40.670 --> 22:42.060
So what if you're Heavenly Elders?

22:42.310 --> 22:43.590
If a rule demands blind obedience despite being wrong,

22:43.790 --> 22:44.920
then it's not worth keeping.

22:45.510 --> 22:45.880
You—

22:46.960 --> 22:47.550
Sovereign Wei,

22:49.310 --> 22:50.270
there's no need to waste your time on this.

22:50.880 --> 22:51.400
Please, go ahead.

22:51.960 --> 22:52.960
Su Yishui!

23:11.440 --> 23:12.440
The soul oath has been made.

23:12.790 --> 23:14.240
Sovereign Wei, you must not forget your vow.

23:29.000 --> 23:29.830
Su Yishui,

23:30.440 --> 23:32.030
the Spirit Spring is incredibly important.

23:32.320 --> 23:33.760
Yet, just for your own safety,

23:33.790 --> 23:34.510
you handed over the key

23:34.530 --> 23:35.810
to Wei Jiu so easily?

23:36.790 --> 23:38.160
If he truly finds the Spirit Spring,

23:38.750 --> 23:39.480
you may come to the Mount Wester

23:39.480 --> 23:40.550
and hold me accountable.

23:40.830 --> 23:41.200
You—

23:43.200 --> 23:44.400
Reckless fools.

23:44.480 --> 23:45.440
Did you come here just to die?

23:45.880 --> 23:47.830
We were worried you might be in danger.

23:48.240 --> 23:49.310
You can't even protect yourselves,

23:49.330 --> 23:50.220
and you still think you can save others?

23:50.790 --> 23:51.640
If this happens again,

23:51.750 --> 23:52.720
I won't let you off so easily.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.640
Yes, Master.

24:01.790 --> 24:03.440
My disciples are still inexperienced,

24:03.830 --> 24:04.830
and they've been through quite a fright.

24:05.350 --> 24:06.790
We'll take our leave first—

24:07.070 --> 24:07.920
see you all later.

24:08.440 --> 24:09.000
Shui—

24:11.310 --> 24:12.240
How could this be?

24:12.970 --> 24:13.690
Didn't he clearly

24:13.720 --> 24:14.680
have feelings for Sister?

24:15.350 --> 24:16.350
Did I misunderstand?

24:17.160 --> 24:17.920
Miss Mu,

24:18.550 --> 24:20.680
it looks like you won't be returning to Mount Wester anytime soon.

24:21.400 --> 24:22.110
Why not

24:22.200 --> 24:23.440
come with me to the Eternal Sect instead?

24:23.960 --> 24:25.550
I'll personally take you as my disciple.

24:27.350 --> 24:28.920
Immortal Kaiyuan, you are renowned for your wisdom and virtue.

24:29.270 --> 24:30.900
I would be honored to become your disciple.

24:36.590 --> 24:37.680
The entrance to the netherworld...

24:38.350 --> 24:39.750
I've finally found it.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.240
My Lord,

25:03.550 --> 25:05.070
there's a soul seal placed on this key.

25:05.400 --> 25:06.400
It can't be opened at all.

25:06.790 --> 25:08.360
Su Yishui...

25:15.790 --> 25:16.440
Elder Tu,

25:16.720 --> 25:18.270
what is the Lord trying to do?

25:18.720 --> 25:19.510
The Blazing Sword

25:19.510 --> 25:21.110
was forged by the Mortal-Demon Lord himself.

25:21.350 --> 25:23.070
If the Spirit Spring is nearby,

25:23.090 --> 25:24.620
the Blazing Sword should react to its presence.

25:25.510 --> 25:27.240
The Scarlet Sect was originally founded by the Mortal-Demon Lord

25:27.260 --> 25:28.590
and is descended from the Celestial Sect.

25:28.990 --> 25:31.100
Sadly, during the great war between the Immortals and Demons,

25:31.260 --> 25:32.460
the Celestial Sect was wiped out.

25:32.600 --> 25:33.800
Its gates were then closed off,

25:34.240 --> 25:36.090
leading to the decline of demonic cultivators.

25:36.830 --> 25:38.960
The Lord is determined to revive the era of demonic cultivation,

25:39.200 --> 25:40.920
so we must reopen the gates of the Celestial Sect.

25:41.680 --> 25:42.960
The gates of the Celestial Sect

25:43.200 --> 25:44.750
can only be opened with

25:44.750 --> 25:46.160
the Blazing Sword, cleansed by the Spirit Spring.

25:48.680 --> 25:50.590
The Spirit Spring isn't in the netherworld at all.

25:51.480 --> 25:52.350
Su Yishui.

25:52.700 --> 25:53.880
How dare you trick me!

25:54.790 --> 25:55.480
Fine.

25:56.030 --> 25:57.200
You asked for this.

26:01.830 --> 26:03.750
That was far too close today.

26:04.030 --> 26:05.920
That impostor Mu Ranwu almost

26:06.070 --> 26:07.000
gave us away.

26:07.760 --> 26:09.110
Fortunately, Ranran arrived in time.

26:10.880 --> 26:12.000
Though, I would much rather

26:12.030 --> 26:13.430
she stay out of all this danger.

26:14.250 --> 26:15.040
The Mu Qingge of the past

26:15.070 --> 26:16.000
always cared about others

26:16.020 --> 26:16.780
while neglecting herself.

26:17.160 --> 26:18.160
But Ranran now—

26:18.730 --> 26:19.800
I only want her to live for herself,

26:19.830 --> 26:20.830
nothing more.

26:23.030 --> 26:23.790
What a pity...

26:24.590 --> 26:25.920
That time, she only managed to

26:26.480 --> 26:27.830
break the Burning Curse by accident.

26:28.370 --> 26:29.890
The Silencing Curse between us remains intact.

26:30.640 --> 26:31.640
If only I could say it—

26:31.640 --> 26:32.530
that I am the real demon.

26:36.940 --> 26:38.530
If only I could reveal the truth,

26:39.000 --> 26:40.590
everyone would know she is innocent.

26:41.130 --> 26:41.850
Then there would be no need

26:41.880 --> 26:43.310
to keep hiding Ranran's true identity.

26:43.880 --> 26:44.750
Forget it.

26:45.960 --> 26:48.350
Right now, the most important thing

26:48.880 --> 26:50.200
is to deal with the Soul-Devouring Lock.

26:51.660 --> 26:52.630
You checked on her today.

26:53.030 --> 26:54.830
Is it truly impossible to remove

26:55.160 --> 26:56.300
the Soul-Devouring Lock from Mu Ranwu's body?

26:59.310 --> 27:01.240
The sisters share the same bloodline,

27:01.790 --> 27:02.790
which makes the Soul-Devouring Lock

27:02.790 --> 27:03.550
even more unbreakable.

27:03.650 --> 27:04.520
Their spiritual power rises and falls

27:04.550 --> 27:05.480
in opposition to each other.

27:05.830 --> 27:07.640
With Ranran's Spirit Root still damaged,

27:08.030 --> 27:08.640
she stands no chance

27:08.640 --> 27:09.400
against Mu Ranwu as she is now.

27:10.440 --> 27:11.590
I fear she won't even be able to hold onto

27:11.590 --> 27:12.960
the little power she's just cultivated.

27:14.210 --> 27:15.520
In a while, I'll visit

27:15.550 --> 27:16.880
a few artifact forgers I know

27:17.480 --> 27:18.160
and see

27:18.160 --> 27:18.960
if there's any other way.

27:19.960 --> 27:20.640
But...

27:21.960 --> 27:23.240
What about Mu Ranwu?

27:23.590 --> 27:24.480
To break the Soul-Devouring Lock,

27:24.510 --> 27:25.510
she must be present.

27:25.680 --> 27:26.270
And

27:26.880 --> 27:27.960
before the Soul-Devouring Lock is broken—

27:27.960 --> 27:28.680
if she dies,

27:28.960 --> 27:29.830
you will

27:29.830 --> 27:30.640
perish along with her.

27:31.050 --> 27:31.610
That's why

27:31.640 --> 27:32.680
you should have brought her back just now,

27:32.680 --> 27:33.790
no matter what.

27:34.200 --> 27:34.750
As for her,

27:35.480 --> 27:36.310
there's no need to worry.

27:37.110 --> 27:38.440
Immortal Kaiyuan is keeping her imprisoned

27:38.440 --> 27:39.440
within the Immortal-Binding Formation.

27:39.750 --> 27:40.790
If I were to take her away,

27:40.880 --> 27:41.750
it wouldn't be easy.

27:42.350 --> 27:43.640
We might as well leave this trouble

27:44.030 --> 27:44.880
to Su Yu instead.

27:46.270 --> 27:46.750
Who?

27:47.270 --> 27:47.920
Su Yu?

27:52.110 --> 27:53.480
So you did it on purpose.

27:54.240 --> 27:55.310
You heard

27:55.310 --> 27:56.350
my message

27:56.440 --> 27:57.510
and came up with another plan.

27:58.200 --> 27:59.510
In any case, Su Yu will seek her out

27:59.510 --> 28:00.400
and ensure her safety.

28:04.150 --> 28:05.040
The Crown Prince himself

28:05.070 --> 28:06.440
will have a much easier time

28:07.000 --> 28:08.270
dealing with those Heavenly Sects than we ever could.

28:08.910 --> 28:10.020
As for Mu Ranwu,

28:10.400 --> 28:12.000
Wei Jiu has already infused the Reincarnation Tree

28:12.440 --> 28:13.440
with Resentment Liquid.

28:14.030 --> 28:15.110
If she wants to survive,

28:15.720 --> 28:17.070
she will come to Mount Wester to find me.

28:17.550 --> 28:18.640
But if

28:18.670 --> 28:20.430
Mu Ranwu really falls under Wei Jiu's control,

28:20.890 --> 28:21.690
wouldn't you suffer

28:21.720 --> 28:22.640
alongside them?

28:24.440 --> 28:25.240
That's exactly why

28:25.830 --> 28:27.310
I'm preparing a grand gift for Wei Jiu.

28:27.790 --> 28:28.550
A grand gift?

28:29.110 --> 28:29.790
What are you planning?

28:36.590 --> 28:38.110
Master is so handsome.

28:39.270 --> 28:40.070
Now I understand

28:40.540 --> 28:41.620
why Grandmaster was so determined

28:41.640 --> 28:43.400
to lure Master to Mount Wester back then.

28:57.310 --> 28:58.240
The pattern,

28:58.640 --> 28:59.510
the color,

29:00.160 --> 29:01.350
even the flickering spiritual energy

29:01.350 --> 29:02.920
at the broken edge are exactly the same.

29:03.680 --> 29:06.550
Could it be that the branch Master gave me

29:07.680 --> 29:08.590
is from the Reincarnation Tree?

29:09.970 --> 29:11.880
Why does carrying this branch

29:12.160 --> 29:13.960
keep my body safe and sound?

29:15.400 --> 29:17.160
And for that brief moment,

29:17.360 --> 29:18.560
why did I feel my spiritual power

29:18.590 --> 29:19.680
resonating with the Reincarnation Tree?

29:20.270 --> 29:21.110
Could it be that I...

29:22.720 --> 29:23.920
What's the real reason?

29:32.470 --> 29:33.240
Today,

29:33.960 --> 29:35.440
we owe our thanks to Grandmaster

29:35.740 --> 29:36.370
as she

29:36.390 --> 29:37.550
broke Wei Jiu's formation for us.

29:37.960 --> 29:39.720
Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.

29:40.960 --> 29:42.110
However,

29:42.550 --> 29:44.480
I always thought Master and Grandmaster

29:44.510 --> 29:46.200
were mortal enemies,

29:46.360 --> 29:47.970
destined to fight to the death

29:48.000 --> 29:49.240
when they met again after 18 years.

29:50.000 --> 29:50.750
I never imagined

29:50.880 --> 29:52.720
it would end just like that.

29:53.570 --> 29:54.850
You don't understand.

29:55.240 --> 29:56.710
Master has already reached a higher state of mind.

29:56.880 --> 29:59.160
The grudges of the past have long since faded like the wind.

30:00.630 --> 30:02.150
She is now as calm as the breeze and as bright as the moon,

30:02.240 --> 30:03.310
standing above the world in quiet solitude.

30:09.680 --> 30:10.510
What's wrong, Xi'er?

30:10.790 --> 30:12.200
I can't see anymore.

30:20.530 --> 30:21.600
I once heard

30:21.620 --> 30:23.070
Yu Tong say that

30:23.480 --> 30:25.000
before Master was cursed,

30:25.310 --> 30:27.960
he hated being stared at the most,

30:28.030 --> 30:29.070
especially

30:29.720 --> 30:31.540
when people praised his looks.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.680
I won't look at him anymore.

30:39.000 --> 30:40.240
You're a real jinx.

30:41.160 --> 30:42.640
We truly can't afford to cross you.

30:44.690 --> 30:45.770
As for Mu Ranwu,

30:46.000 --> 30:47.310
I've asked Yu Chen to keep an eye on her in secret.

30:47.880 --> 30:48.720
You should hurry and see

30:48.720 --> 30:49.440
if there's any other way

30:49.460 --> 30:50.490
to break the Soul-Devouring Lock.

30:50.650 --> 30:51.610
We'll split up.

30:51.920 --> 30:52.480
Alright.

30:57.860 --> 31:00.850
[Locust Forest]

31:00.920 --> 31:02.240
What do you think is wrong with Ranran?

31:02.310 --> 31:03.510
She seems preoccupied throughout the journey.

31:03.640 --> 31:04.240
Don't look.

31:07.240 --> 31:08.310
Master seems to

31:08.330 --> 31:09.980
be hiding many secrets in his heart.

31:11.240 --> 31:12.750
If my suspicions are correct,

31:13.280 --> 31:14.590
then why is he keeping it from me?

31:15.830 --> 31:17.310
If I ask him directly,

31:17.750 --> 31:19.680
will he tell me the truth?

31:20.960 --> 31:22.790
You've been deep in thought this whole journey.

31:23.310 --> 31:24.750
Do you have something to say to me?

31:25.510 --> 31:26.110
I...

31:27.230 --> 31:27.860
Forget it.

31:28.440 --> 31:29.110
Now might not be

31:29.110 --> 31:30.350
the right time to talk about this.

31:30.750 --> 31:31.510
Master,

31:31.920 --> 31:33.350
is Wei Jiu catching up to us?

31:33.790 --> 31:34.720
How did you know?

31:35.920 --> 31:36.480
Since Wei Jiu

31:36.510 --> 31:37.780
has been searching for the Spirit Spring all this time,

31:37.960 --> 31:39.440
he'll definitely head straight for the netherworld

31:39.550 --> 31:40.880
once he gets the key.

31:41.240 --> 31:42.880
Being as vindictive as he is,

31:43.070 --> 31:44.440
once he realizes he's been tricked,

31:44.500 --> 31:45.500
he'll surely be furious

31:45.680 --> 31:46.480
and come for revenge.

31:47.070 --> 31:47.680
Master!

31:48.790 --> 31:49.440
Master!

31:49.920 --> 31:51.240
It feels like someone is following us.

31:52.150 --> 31:53.350
It must be Wei Jiu's people.

31:53.600 --> 31:54.440
Wei Jiu?

31:54.830 --> 31:56.110
He still wants to come after us?

31:56.920 --> 31:58.160
What should we do now?

31:58.180 --> 31:58.880
Each of you, find a tree

31:58.880 --> 31:59.680
wrapped in thick vines,

31:59.700 --> 32:00.570
climb up, and hide there.

32:00.960 --> 32:01.790
No one is allowed to come down

32:01.960 --> 32:02.830
unless I give the order.

32:03.240 --> 32:03.920
Understood.

32:35.350 --> 32:36.270
Bai?

32:52.030 --> 32:53.520
Could this be a formation?

33:28.190 --> 33:29.950
You're using a wild cat as the formation's core?

33:31.840 --> 33:32.840
Bai, danger!

33:50.030 --> 33:51.070
Ironclad White Tiger?

34:29.719 --> 34:30.960
You despicable Su scoundrel!

34:31.710 --> 34:32.960
You merged with the vines

34:33.139 --> 34:34.790
to control the wisteria and drain my power.

34:39.310 --> 34:40.739
And you dare call yourself a paragon of righteousness?

34:41.199 --> 34:42.030
Even I, a demonic cultivator,

34:42.320 --> 34:43.440
wouldn't sink to

34:43.440 --> 34:44.360
such deceitful tricks!

34:47.190 --> 34:48.120
When did I ever claim

34:48.150 --> 34:49.360
to be a paragon of righteousness?

34:49.760 --> 34:50.320
You—

34:56.960 --> 34:58.550
You planted the demonic vines in advance

34:58.920 --> 35:00.550
and lured me into your trap on purpose!

35:03.840 --> 35:04.920
So you're saying that

35:05.070 --> 35:06.000
once you absorb

35:06.030 --> 35:07.230
Wei Jiu's power,

35:07.950 --> 35:09.590
the Resentment Liquid will be yours to control?

35:10.230 --> 35:11.830
The last few times I fought Wei Jiu,

35:12.450 --> 35:13.840
I had to hold back

35:13.840 --> 35:14.360
to avoid exposing

35:14.760 --> 35:15.760
myself and Ranran.

35:16.360 --> 35:17.360
Today is the perfect opportunity

35:17.480 --> 35:18.770
to make him pay for everything.

35:26.320 --> 35:27.150
Su Yishui!

35:27.660 --> 35:28.800
If others find out

35:28.800 --> 35:29.670
that you're secretly cultivating demonic vines,

35:29.720 --> 35:31.360
your reputation will be utterly ruined.

35:33.320 --> 35:35.400
I told you over a decade ago

35:35.840 --> 35:37.070
to stay away from me,

35:37.750 --> 35:39.060
or else I'd kill you.

36:19.670 --> 36:21.480
Now that I've absorbed half of Wei Jiu's spiritual power,

36:22.830 --> 36:24.500
the Resentment Liquid in Mu Ranwu's body

36:25.260 --> 36:27.050
is also under my control.

36:39.360 --> 36:40.110
Sovereign!

36:40.190 --> 36:40.800
Sovereign!

37:00.790 --> 37:01.910
That Su Yishui

37:02.670 --> 37:04.440
drapes himself in righteousness,

37:05.110 --> 37:06.760
but beneath it, he's as black as ink.

37:09.550 --> 37:10.550
Su Yishui,

37:11.600 --> 37:13.150
this is a feud that will never end!

37:16.190 --> 37:16.960
Master.

37:21.110 --> 37:22.400
Didn't I tell you

37:22.630 --> 37:23.400
not to come down from the tree

37:23.400 --> 37:24.510
without my order?

37:26.230 --> 37:27.000
I...

37:27.670 --> 37:29.070
I saw that Bai was in danger at that moment.

37:29.280 --> 37:29.840
Does that mean

37:29.840 --> 37:31.030
you can just ignore your own safety?

37:32.430 --> 37:33.110
Do you really think the Ironclad White Tiger

37:33.110 --> 37:34.160
needs your concern?

37:38.590 --> 37:40.280
I didn't know it was a White Tiger Divine Beast.

37:40.360 --> 37:42.070
I couldn't just stand by and watch it die.

37:42.510 --> 37:43.150
Besides,

37:43.400 --> 37:44.630
I'm fine, aren't I?

37:49.630 --> 37:50.440
How many lives do you have

37:50.440 --> 37:52.080
to squander again and again?

37:59.710 --> 38:00.440
Xue Ranran.

38:01.960 --> 38:03.480
I warned you before

38:04.030 --> 38:05.150
not to risk yourself for others

38:05.150 --> 38:06.000
so recklessly.

38:07.000 --> 38:08.280
Did my words just go in one ear and out the other?

38:11.760 --> 38:12.710
Come back with me and reflect on your mistakes.

38:19.160 --> 38:20.490
[Wester Sect]

38:22.960 --> 38:23.480
You,

38:23.920 --> 38:24.840
stay here and reflect.

38:29.480 --> 38:30.070
I've thought it over,

38:30.440 --> 38:31.280
but I'm still not convinced.

38:32.110 --> 38:32.670
What?

38:33.030 --> 38:34.110
They say stopping evil and doing good

38:34.110 --> 38:35.360
is a cultivator's duty,

38:35.560 --> 38:36.330
yet must we still constantly weigh

38:36.360 --> 38:37.000
what should be done

38:37.020 --> 38:38.140
and what shouldn't?

38:38.510 --> 38:39.710
If saving Bai

38:39.710 --> 38:40.710
was reckless of me,

38:40.840 --> 38:41.760
then wasn't Master the same

38:41.920 --> 38:43.550
when you sacrificed

38:43.600 --> 38:44.890
half your Golden Core

38:44.920 --> 38:45.710
to resurrect Grandmaster,

38:45.810 --> 38:46.890
endured 18 years of seclusion to recover from grave injuries,

38:46.920 --> 38:47.800
all just to save the Westers?

38:49.960 --> 38:51.440
My original intent was to break the curse.

38:51.670 --> 38:52.590
I did it for myself.

38:52.760 --> 38:53.630
If that's the case,

38:53.920 --> 38:55.280
then I did it for myself too.

38:55.710 --> 38:56.880
Bai was implicated because of me.

38:56.960 --> 38:57.840
I couldn't just ignore it.

38:58.840 --> 39:00.030
How was it implicated by you?

39:00.190 --> 39:01.440
That's complete nonsense.

39:01.840 --> 39:02.590
Then tell me, Master.

39:03.030 --> 39:03.710
Why was Wei Jiu

39:03.730 --> 39:05.000
after me in the first place?

39:05.710 --> 39:07.070
And why did you feed me

39:07.070 --> 39:08.710
the Black Dragon blood that to conceal my energy?

39:11.880 --> 39:13.150
Wei Jiu came back to hunt us down—

39:13.800 --> 39:14.710
aside from seeking revenge on you

39:14.730 --> 39:16.040
for deceiving him into making a soul oath,

39:16.810 --> 39:17.680
wasn't it also because

39:17.710 --> 39:18.880
he found me again?

39:19.230 --> 39:20.030
If that's the case,

39:20.230 --> 39:21.840
then Xiao Bai was indeed implicated because of me.

39:23.150 --> 39:23.960
Ridiculous.

39:24.700 --> 39:26.010
What could he possibly have discovered about you?

39:27.190 --> 39:28.110
I don't know either.

39:29.030 --> 39:30.920
Perhaps it's related to the spiritual fruit of the Reincarnation Tree.

39:31.920 --> 39:33.230
Master gave this to me.

39:33.710 --> 39:34.360
It's actually

39:34.710 --> 39:36.480
a branch from the Reincarnation Tree,

39:36.710 --> 39:37.360
isn't it?

39:38.160 --> 39:38.930
Why else would it

39:38.960 --> 39:40.030
nourish my heart,

39:40.510 --> 39:41.190
and why would I be on the brink of death

39:41.320 --> 39:42.510
the moment I'm away from it?

39:45.080 --> 39:46.600
Who am I, really?

39:47.070 --> 39:48.880
Why have you been hiding the truth from me all this time?

39:49.600 --> 39:50.560
You did say that

39:50.760 --> 39:52.190
when the time was right, I would understand.

39:53.190 --> 39:54.590
But now, doubts surround me—

39:55.030 --> 39:55.880
they cloud my mind

39:55.880 --> 39:56.760
and hinder my cultivation.

40:00.880 --> 40:01.550
You're right.

40:02.190 --> 40:02.840
What I gave you

40:02.860 --> 40:04.380
is indeed a branch from the Reincarnation Tree.

40:04.760 --> 40:05.550
And you are indeed

40:05.550 --> 40:06.670
a fruit born from the Reincarnation Tree.

40:07.880 --> 40:09.070
You once told me

40:09.960 --> 40:10.960
you took me as a disciple

40:10.960 --> 40:12.320
because of an old acquaintance.

40:12.960 --> 40:14.360
Could that acquaintance...

40:15.030 --> 40:16.030
It was you yourself.

40:19.190 --> 40:20.400
The reincarnation technique is a forbidden art.

40:21.030 --> 40:22.360
When I attempted to revive Mu Qingge,

40:22.670 --> 40:23.800
I experimented with it more than once.

40:24.150 --> 40:25.150
It was not an immediate success.

40:25.800 --> 40:26.880
But what I didn't expect

40:27.070 --> 40:28.070
was that in the process,

40:28.070 --> 40:29.320
a wandering soul would be nurtured

40:29.840 --> 40:31.070
and reincarnate into a fruit as well.

40:33.020 --> 40:34.460
Am I that wandering soul?

40:35.230 --> 40:35.960
You fell from the Reincarnation Tree

40:35.960 --> 40:37.070
too soon,

40:37.630 --> 40:38.840
causing damage to your heart.

40:39.230 --> 40:39.880
I have a responsibility

40:40.280 --> 40:41.070
toward you.

40:42.150 --> 40:42.760
That's why you

40:42.760 --> 40:44.230
insisted on taking me as a disciple—

40:44.920 --> 40:46.230
to mend my heart

40:46.590 --> 40:47.590
and protect me in every way.

40:50.000 --> 40:51.320
Then what about Wei Jiu?

40:51.840 --> 40:53.150
Wei Jiu is cunning by nature.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.150
He would never let go of

40:54.150 --> 40:55.360
any reincarnation fruit.

40:55.710 --> 40:57.030
That's why you were drawn into this.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.190
Now that Mu Qingge has returned to this world,

40:58.940 --> 41:05.640
♫Who knows the loneliness of mountains and seas?♫

41:00.510 --> 41:01.510
if he seeks the Spirit Spring,

41:01.580 --> 41:02.710
he will go after Mu Qingge directly.

41:03.070 --> 41:04.110
You have nothing to do with it anymore.

41:05.950 --> 41:12.270
♫The sharp wind cuts at my heart♫

41:07.630 --> 41:08.480
So...

41:09.480 --> 41:11.000
I truly have no parents.

41:11.620 --> 41:12.870
I am nothing but a fruit.

41:12.680 --> 41:16.230
♫Hold a drop of blood♫

41:16.390 --> 41:18.370
I grew up eating from many different households,

41:16.610 --> 41:20.380
♫Tattered flowers and tears♫

41:19.350 --> 41:21.100
never knowing who my parents were,

41:20.760 --> 41:26.350
♫Reincarnating but to no avail♫

41:22.150 --> 41:23.670
and never knowing where to even begin looking.

41:25.070 --> 41:26.960
Now I finally understand.

41:27.090 --> 41:33.700
♫Devoting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

41:30.400 --> 41:31.590
Master, since you saved me,

41:32.400 --> 41:33.190
then do you know

41:33.510 --> 41:34.800
who I once was?

41:34.210 --> 41:40.290
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

41:36.800 --> 41:38.150
Yesterday was yesterday.

41:38.590 --> 41:39.760
What does it matter to your life now?

41:40.550 --> 41:41.510
So,

41:41.080 --> 41:44.580
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

41:41.690 --> 41:43.500
you do know my past.

41:43.840 --> 41:45.070
Right now, you are Xue Ranran.

41:44.690 --> 41:48.350
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

41:45.710 --> 41:46.710
As for your past—

41:47.030 --> 41:47.550
someday...

41:47.550 --> 41:48.150
When the time is right,

41:48.190 --> 41:49.150
I will understand, right?

41:49.330 --> 41:56.040
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

41:49.440 --> 41:51.110
Yes, you have said that before.

41:51.710 --> 41:53.070
But if I could learn my past,

41:53.280 --> 41:53.920
perhaps I could help

41:53.920 --> 41:55.280
Ling Xiao find his soul owner.

41:56.770 --> 41:59.470
♫There's no need to discuss right or wrong♫

41:57.790 --> 41:58.660
It is irrelevant.

41:59.670 --> 42:03.330
♫I can sacrifice my life♫

42:01.960 --> 42:02.920
I understand.

42:03.730 --> 42:06.610
♫All rules can be dismantled♫

42:04.000 --> 42:05.110
I will not ask further.

42:06.780 --> 42:10.320
♫Die in this world♫

42:11.160 --> 42:17.760
♫The masses spread rumors that are hard to swallow♫

42:11.190 --> 42:12.030
Xue Ranran,

42:13.360 --> 42:14.440
living freely

42:14.840 --> 42:15.550
and at peace—

42:16.030 --> 42:17.190
that is what matters most.

42:18.050 --> 42:21.460
♫Sealing your lips, never to speak again♫

42:21.600 --> 42:25.010
♫Even if I were to leap into the abyss♫

42:25.880 --> 42:33.270
♫If, to you, falling is merely a homeward journey♫

42:54.110 --> 42:54.760
Ranran.

42:57.600 --> 42:58.930
As soon as I walked in,

42:58.960 --> 42:59.840
I caught a strong, heavy scent—

42:59.840 --> 43:01.010
like a pot on the verge of burning through.

43:04.980 --> 43:06.620
Is something bothering you?

43:08.760 --> 43:09.920
Can I help?

43:12.150 --> 43:13.110
I'll tell you—

43:14.000 --> 43:15.280
but don't be too shocked.
